From 3cadd4a36eec0b6bc854c9c306556e7ab681f13a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thiago Antonio Miranda <tmarques@windriver.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 13:44:10 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add artifact env, mounts and backup rootwrap to Cinder

Support operator environment variables and plugin-generated artifact
delivery in the cinder-volume and cinder-backup containers.

- Add pod.env.<component>, rendered in the matching container only,
  and compose a single PYTHONPATH from the operator literal followed
  by the generated artifact paths, both used as supplied. A value that
  is not a string, manual or generated, fails the render.
- Combine pod.mounts with pod.artifacts volumes and volumeMounts,
  keeping equivalent mappings once and failing the render on artifact
  destinations that are not clean absolute paths, parent or child
  destination overlaps, incompatible mappings at the same destination,
  conflicts with the chart's own fixed and conditional destinations,
  volume names the chart itself declares, and volume names reused
  with a different definition. One artifact volume may back several
  destinations. Without artifact values the operator mount lists are
  passed through unchanged, so legacy-only configurations are
  unaffected. The destination guard protects the chart's own mounts;
  it does not confine an artifact, which runs with the privileges of
  its container.
- Mount additional rootwrap filter files in cinder-backup, honouring
  pods: [backup] and pods: [volume, backup] and keeping
  volume.filters exactly once.

With the new inputs unset the rendered workloads are unchanged.

Signed-off-by: Thiago Antonio Miranda <tmarques@windriver.com>
---
 cinder/templates/deployment-backup.yaml       |  22 +-
 cinder/templates/deployment-volume.yaml       |  11 +-
 cinder/templates/utils/_artifact_env.tpl      |  31 +++
 cinder/templates/utils/_artifact_mounts.tpl   | 198 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../templates/utils/_compose_pythonpath.tpl   |  49 +++++
 cinder/values.yaml                            |  38 ++++
 6 files changed, 345 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 cinder/templates/utils/_artifact_env.tpl
 create mode 100644 cinder/templates/utils/_artifact_mounts.tpl
 create mode 100644 cinder/templates/utils/_compose_pythonpath.tpl

